### 获取资产分页列表（带用户信息）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/assets/list?current=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 新增资产
POST http://localhost:8080/api/assets/add
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assetName": "Dell 27-inch Monitor",
  "assetSn": "SN2026-M-001",
  "category": "Electronics",
  "price": 35000.00,
  "location": "Room 501",
  "purchaseDate": "2026-01-07"
}

### 新增资产（error 空 SN）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/assets/add
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assetName": "Dell 27-inch Monitor",
  "assetSn": "",
  "category": "Macbook m1",
  "price": 38000.00,
  "location": "Room 501",
  "purchaseDate": "2026-01-07"
}



### 资产领用
# 注意：这里的 assetId 请根据上面 list 接口返回的真实 ID 修改
POST http://localhost:8080/api/assets/claim
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assetId": 1,
  "remark": "初次领用"
}

### 异常测试：重复领用（预期报错）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/assets/claim
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assetId": 1,
  "remark": "再次尝试领用"
}


### 资产退库 (测试权限校验)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/assets/return
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assetId": 1,
  "remark": "设备完好，申请入库"
}

